-- ==============================================================================
-- Tytul:        ext1.prm
-- Opis:         Parametry per-PDB Integrated Extract ext1 (blok 7 raportu): logowanie aliasem
--               z credential store, trail et, DDL tabel mapowanych, schematy HR i SALES.
-- Description [EN]: Parameters of the per-PDB Integrated Extract ext1 (report block 7): login by
--               credential store alias, trail et, DDL of mapped tables, schemas HR and SALES.
-- Autor: KCB Kris | Data: 2026-11-14 | Wersja: 1.0 | Konwencje: <repo>/SETTINGS.md
-- Uzycie / Usage: 88_oggconf_source.sh kopiuje do <deployment>/etc/conf/ogg/ext1.prm
-- ==============================================================================
EXTRACT ext1
USERIDALIAS ggsource DOMAIN OracleGoldenGate
TRANLOGOPTIONS INTEGRATEDPARAMS (max_sga_size 512, parallelism 2)
-- LOGALLSUPCOLS and UPDATERECORDFORMAT COMPACT are defaults in 26: not repeated here
WARNLONGTRANS 2H, CHECKINTERVAL 30M
EXTTRAIL et
-- LAB: DDL parameter not checked in the 26ai Reference (test T10)
DDL INCLUDE MAPPED
TABLE HR.*;
TABLE SALES.*;
